# Shared environment for every Tomcat container (andromeda, nebula, chess, robak).
#
# Intentionally empty. Each application reads its own configuration from
# env/tomcat/<app>-*.properties, which compose mounts into
# /usr/local/tomcat/conf/ inside the container. This file exists because the
# compose services reference it via env_file; leave it empty unless you need a
# variable shared by ALL Tomcat containers.
